howed all 129 Python cases had run, and\nthe single ERROR was raised from the TemporaryDirectory finalizer:\n\n  OSError: [Errno 39] directory not empty: 'objects'\n\n'git gc --auto' can run DETACHED after a commit or push, so it can still be\nrepacking .git/objects while unittest's TemporaryDirectory cleanup walks the\nfixture tree; unittest reports that finalizer error as a case ERROR even\nthough every assertion passed. The fixtures are disposable, so auto-gc buys\nnothing: gc.auto=0 is now set in init_repo and on the bare origin, removing\nthe race at its source rather than swallowing cleanup errors with\nignore_cleanup_errors.\n\nVerified locally: 129/129 cases pass on three consecutive runs, and the\nRacket wrapper reports no rackunit failure.","timestamp":"2026-09-25T03:18:02Z","author":{"name":"CI Fixture","email":"ci@example.invalid"},"committer":{"name":"CI Fixture","email":"ci@example.invalid"}},"repository":{"id":1204314088,"node_id":"R_kgDOR8hf6A","name":"q","full_name":"coinerd/q","private":false,"owner":{"login":"coinerd","id":10107520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10107520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd","html_url":"https://github.com/coinerd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coinerd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/coinerd/q","d